# Everything under data/ is ignored by default, and the exceptions are listed
# below. This file listed each ignorable path individually until 2026-08-26,
# which is the wrong way round for a directory whose whole purpose is holding
# things too big to vendor: a dataset nobody had thought of yet was *tracked*
# by default, and the commit that swept it in would be an ordinary `git add -A`.
# Reversed, a new dataset is safe the moment it lands and an addition to the
# repo has to be argued for in this file.
data/*
!data/standards/

# Derived artefacts, trained weights, evaluation output -- all rebuilt by scripts
models/
runs/               # ultralytics writes its training runs here, under its own prefix
eval/results/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.DS_Store
.pytest_cache/

# demo recordings are produced locally (scratch demo_record.py) and published to YouTube
docs/demo/*.mp4
